    "directions": [
      "In a bowl, add refined flour, corn flour, black pepper powder.",
      "Add garlic powder, italian seasoning, degi red chilli powder, salt to taste.",
      "Add some water to make a paste just enough to coat the chicken pieces well.",
      "Add chicken strips in the batter and then coat in corn flakes from all the sides.",
      "Repeat this step for the rest of the chicken strips.",
      "When oil is hot enough ,deep fry chicken strips until golden brown on both sides. Remove & drain on a paper towel.",
      "Serve crispy & crunchy chicken fingers with tomato"
    ],
